 Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Bob Refs ⌘S: scan for new references from the panel[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pressing ⌘S in the Bob Refs panel runs `bob ref scan -w` in the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]background, reports exactly which references the scan added, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]puts those references at the top of the panel, selected. The panel [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]stays usable, the scan survives the panel hiding, and every outcome[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](added, nothing new, partial, failed) is reported calmly and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]honestly.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob_refs_scan_keymap.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/bob_refs_scan_keymap.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5x[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5x/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob ref scan gains a JSON report and a writer lock[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-scan-json[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-scan-json: add `-f/--format human|json` to `bob ref scan` with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]versioned envelope that names every created and updated note, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pure-JSON stdout (hook chatter goes to stderr), coded hard-failure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]envelopes, and an exclusive lock that serializes writing scans; document[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it and cover it with CLI tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]RefsCore scan contract, report decoding, and the Just scanned [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]section[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-scan-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-scan-core: decode the scan envelope, build a RefsScanOutcome and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its exact presentation strings, add BobProcessClient.decodeReport, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]RefsFetching.scan, and add the time-windowed Just scanned browse section[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with its caption and why-here line, all Linux-testable.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Scan lane in RefsLibrary and scan behavior in RefsPanelModel[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-scan-service[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs-scan-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-scan-service: run the scan on its own lane with a long timeout, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]defer watcher refreshes while it runs, publish the outcome only after a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-scan snapshot pass, then re-rank, select the first new reference, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]raise banners, and queue hidden notices in the panel model, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fake-bob coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]⌘S key, footer status, banners, notifications, docs, and [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]renders[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-scan-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after refs-scan-service, cli-scan-json[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-scan-ui: route ⌘S and the ⌘K item, draw the footer scan status, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Just scanned header, the no-match hint, and the Scan Again banner [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]action, post notifications when the panel is hidden, document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]feature in the README, check fixture parity with the real bob envelope, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and review light and dark renders.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5x","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-5x.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-da87a8d1f6b9f32ea4cc327dc0a712be","started_at":"2026-10-09T16:29:55.196790+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"86b16c91d6f3c9e221e0df38eb645df3f033d19aed658c609c3e8457f4e88777","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5x.2--mon-0/chat.md","size_bytes":25088},"commits":{"digest":"ba80baef56b18991bf1525f4452c5c6a72d5c1deb23a6d6d6464fcfe14c7154c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5x.2--mon-0/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"10a8ca66872fd2cfed291a3f6f2b687b3c45fe769fd476386d7ae9a5e1033f8c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5x.2--mon-0/meta.json","size_bytes":692},"state":{"digest":"8ed2009c446dd01db01fd128124d2642b2c24a4b8a0135eb1688fd7d31096b13","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5x.2--mon-0/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-10-09T17:02:33.232397+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-5x.2--mon-0","local_name":"bob-cli-5x.2--mon-0","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-5x","agent_clan_generation":"20261009122742","agent_session":"bob-cli-5x.2","agent_session_role":"mon-0","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"mon-0","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-5x.2"},"source_run_id":"run-e0f4450b11a379bf68fc5117b8b952ad","started_at":"2026-10-09T16:57:50.509884+00:00","state":"failed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":